  "description": "Soraka's Wish and Salvation as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): the main pack's Wish heals every allied champion the same amount and its Salvation is a haste after W, because data reads neither anyone's health nor where she walks; with this add-on allied champions below 40% of their maximum health are healed 50% more, read at the moment the stars fall, and she gains 90% move speed while heading for a nearby allied champion below 40% health. Everything else stays the main pack's. Writes a log for testing.",
